What GharKhata is
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

GharKhata (घर + खाता — house account ledger) is an over-engineered
digital version of the daily expense diary found in every Indian
household. It tracks daily variable expenses (milk, laundry, vegetables),
fixed monthly bills (newspaper, house help salary), and produces a
settled monthly statement per payee — implemented with an append-only
event store, a double-entry ledger engine, and a monthly close workflow.

DHELA — Digital Household Expense Ledger App.

